# Hand-written sequence for obj/evc_s076_run: the start of mission of
# runner_pass.scn, then an expectation that is wrong on purpose (Full
# Supervision where the on-board is in Staff Responsible): the runner
# reports it failed at step 18, and the baseline records that it does.
sequence runner_fail
meta version 4.0.0 ; sv 30 ; feature 9000002
step 1 1 0.00 N/A NP I SIM N/A NP
  text: the on-board is switched on
input SIM power on
step 2 2 0.00 N/A NP O JRU N/A SB
  text: the mode Stand By is recorded
expect JRU record ALL M_MODE=6
step 3 3 0.00 N/A SB I TIU N/A SB
  text: the desk of cab A is opened
input TIU cab A active
step 4 4 0.00 N/A SB O DMI N/A SB
  text: the DMI shows Stand By
expect DMI mode-symbol displayed Stand-By
step 5 5 0.00 N/A SB O DMI N/A SB
  text: the DMI asks for the driver identity
expect DMI window displayed Driver-ID
step 6 6 0.00 N/A SB I DMI N/A SB
  text: the driver types an identity
input DMI enter Driver-ID
step 7 7 0.00 N/A SB O DMI N/A SB
  text: the DMI asks for the level
expect DMI window displayed Level
step 8 8 0.00 N/A SB I DMI L1 SB
  text: the driver chooses level 1
input DMI select Level-1
step 9 9 0.00 L1 SB O JRU L1 SB
  text: level 1 is recorded
expect JRU record ALL M_LEVEL=2
step 10 10 0.00 L1 SB I DMI L1 SB
  text: the driver opens the Train Data entry
input DMI press Train-Data
step 11 11 0.00 L1 SB I DMI L1 SB
  text: the driver types the Train Data
input DMI enter Train-Data
step 12 12 0.00 L1 SB I DMI L1 SB
  text: the driver validates them
input DMI validate Train-Data
step 13 13 0.00 L1 SB O JRU L1 SB
  text: the Train Data are recorded
expect JRU record 2
step 14 14 0.00 L1 SB I DMI L1 SB
  text: the driver types a train running number
input DMI enter Train-Running-Number
step 15 15 0.00 L1 SB I DMI L1 SB
  text: the driver presses Start
input DMI press Start
step 16 16 0.00 L1 SB O DMI L1 SB
  text: the DMI asks to acknowledge Staff Responsible
expect DMI mode-symbol displayed Acknowledge-Staff-Responsible
step 17 17 0.00 L1 SB I DMI L1 SR
  text: the driver acknowledges
input DMI acknowledge Staff-Responsible
step 18 18 0.00 L1 SR O DMI L1 SR
  text: wrong on purpose: the DMI shows Full Supervision
expect DMI mode-symbol displayed Full-Supervision
step 19 19 0.00 L1 SR O TIU L1 SR
  text: no brake at standstill in SR
expect TIU emergency-brake not-commanded
